<title>UK: Haven Funding prices 82.5 mln stg Sep 2037 bond.</title>
<headline>Haven Funding prices 82.5 mln stg Sep 2037 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier, has been priced by lead manager Hambros.</p>
<p> BORROWER   HAVEN FUNDING PLC</p>
<p> AMT    82.5 MLN STG  COUPON     8.125     MATURITY   *30.SEP.37</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.986   PAY DATE    11.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.625     REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+65 BP</p>
<p> IBCA (EXP) AA	  LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> S&amp;P  (EXP) AA-	 DENOMS     ONE STG   SALE LIMITS US</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW   ENGLISH    HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 8.0 PCT GILT 2021</p>
<p> NOTES	*DIFFERED ANNUITY WITH AN APPROXIMATE AVERAGE LIFE</p>
<p>		 OF 33.5 YEARS.</p>
<p>		THE DEAL IS SECURED ON A PORTFOLIO OF SECURED LOANS</p>
<p>		 TO FIVE UK HOUSING ASSOCIATIONS.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
